      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fort_Cobb%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Fort Cobb is located west of the center of Caddo County in the valley of the Washita River.",
